flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Browse and search catalogue]
    B --> C[Select product and quantity]
    C --> D{Stock available?}
    D -- No --> E[Show stock warning]
    E --> B
    D -- Yes --> F[Add to cart]
    F --> G{Continue shopping?}
    G -- Yes --> B
    G -- No --> H[Checkout]
    H --> I{Cart valid and stock available?}
    I -- No --> B
    I -- Yes --> J[Simulate payment]
    J --> K[Create order and reduce stock]
    K --> L[PLACED / CONFIRMED]
    L --> M[PACKED]
    M --> N[SHIPPED]
    N --> O[DELIVERED]
    L -. eligible cancellation .-> P[Cancel and restore stock]
    Q[Future reservation] --> R[Check current stock]
    R --> S{Enough stock?}
    S -- Yes --> T[Keep scheduled]
    S -- No --> U[Flag for customer action]
    U --> V[Suggest same-category alternatives]
